;\">Corrida Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida PTN One Mile (12\u201317 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> Gr\u00e1tis<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida PTN Kids Run (4\u201311 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:10<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> Gr\u00e1tis<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida e Caminhada Pela Diabetes 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Corrida e Caminhada Pela Diabetes realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Pra\u00e7a da Can\u00e7\u00e3o, em Coimbra, junto \u00e0s margens do Rio Mondego. O aquecimento decorre \u00e0s 14:45, seguido das partidas \u00e0s 15:00 (PTN One Mile 1600 m), 15:10 (PTN Kids Run 300 m) e 15:15 (Corrida e Caminhada de 5 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem algum custo e qual \u00e9 o limite de participantes?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 100% gratuita em todas as vertentes (Corrida 5 km, Caminhada 5 km, One Mile e Kids Run), devendo ser efetuada online at\u00e9 ao dia 1 de novembro de 2026 ou at\u00e9 ser atingido o limite m\u00e1ximo de 1.500 participantes.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o gratuito?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes inscritos dentro do prazo regulamentar t\u00eam direito a um kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o gratuito que inclui T-shirt oficial, saco oficial, dorsal personalizado (com chip eletr\u00f3nico na corrida de 5 km), medalha finisher, diploma oficial, seguro desportivo e abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido (\u00e1gua e fruta) na meta.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios em disputa na Corrida de 5 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida principal de 5 km atribui pr\u00e9mios individuais aos 3 primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos da Geral Absoluta (18 aos 34 anos) e Masters (35 anos em diante), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us coletivos para a equipa mais numerosa masculina e feminina (m\u00ednimo de 10 elementos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando posso levantar o dorsal e o kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona junto \u00e0 zona de partida, no edif\u00edcio municipal na Pra\u00e7a da Can\u00e7\u00e3o, em Coimbra, na sexta-feira, 13 de novembro, das 17:00 \u00e0s 19:30, e no pr\u00f3prio s\u00e1bado da prova, 14 de novembro, impreterivelmente das 08:00 \u00e0s 12:30.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida e Caminhada Pela Diabetes 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a da Can\u00e7\u00e3o, Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Corrida e Caminhada Pela Diabetes 2026 realiza-se a 14 de novembro na Pra\u00e7a da Can\u00e7\u00e3o, em Coimbra. Provas gr\u00e1tis de 5 km e kids. Garante j\u00e1 a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-e-caminhada-pela-diabetes.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida pela Diabetes\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/5a-corrida-diabetes-2026\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada pela Diabetes\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/5a-corrida-diabetes-2026\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida PTN One Mile (12\u201317 anos)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"pr